* @return `pcntl_wait()` returns the process ID of the child which exited, -1 on error or zero if WNOHANG was provided as an option (on wait3-available systems) and no child was available.
* @link https://www.php.net/manual/en/function.pcntl-wait.php
* @generated from PHP v8.5.8, EXT: pcntl v8.5.8
*/
